    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# STATISTICAL ANALYSIS\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# STEP 13 — Chi-Square + Cramér's V Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Purpose\n",
    "Determine which categorical features are statistically related.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Method\n",
    "Perform Chi-Square test of independence and calculate Cramér's V for effect size.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Formula\n",
    "Chi-Square: χ² = Σ((O-E)²/E)\n",
    "Cramér's V = sqrt(χ² / (n * min(r-1, c-1)))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Chi-Square + Cramér's V Analysis\n",
    "from scipy.stats import chi2_contingency\n",
    "\n",
    "categorical_pairs = [\n",
    "    ('Province', 'Remote'),\n",
    "    ('Province', 'Employment_Type'),\n",
    "    ('Education', 'Experience_Years'),\n",
    "    ('Company_Size', 'Remote'),\n",
    "    ('Industry', 'Employment_Type'),\n",
    "    ('Contract_Type', 'Remote')\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Chi-Square + Cramér's V Analysis:\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "\n",
    "results = []\n",
    "for var1, var2 in categorical_pairs:\n",
    "    contingency_table = pd.crosstab(df[var1], df[var2])\n",
    "    chi2, p_value, dof, expected = chi2_contingency(contingency_table)\n",
    "    n = contingency_table.sum().sum()\n",
    "    cramers_v = np.sqrt(chi2 / (n * min(contingency_table.shape[0]-1, contingency_table.shape[1]-1)))\n",
    "    results.append({\n",
    "        'Variable 1': var1,\n",
    "        'Variable 2': var2,\n",
    "        'Chi2': chi2,\n",
    "        'p-value': p_value,\n",
    "        'Cramers V': cramers_v,\n",
    "        'Significant': 'Yes' if p_value < 0.05 else 'No'\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "results_df = pd.DataFrame(results)\n",
    "print(results_df.to_string(index=False))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Cramér's V Heatmap\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 8))\n",
    "pivot = results_df.pivot(index='Variable 1', columns='Variable 2', values='Cramers V')\n",
    "sns.heatmap(pivot, annot=True, cmap='YlOrRd', fmt='.3f', cbar_kws={'label': \"Cramér's V\"})\n",
    "plt.title(\"Cramér's V Heatmap: Feature Associations\", fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('outputs/stats_cramers_v_heatmap.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# STEP 14 — Conditional Probability Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Purpose\n",
    "Understand how one feature relates to another.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Method\n",
    "Calculate conditional probabilities P(A|B).\n",
    "\n",
    "## Formula\n",
    "P(A|B) = P(A ∩ B) / P(B)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Conditional Probability Analysis\n",
    "print(\"Conditional Probability Analysis:\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*60)\n",
    "\n",
    "# P(Remote | Province)\n",
